     1	//! Hybrid mutation API for `VerilogModule`.
     2	//!
     3	//! Preserves the parsed interface (ports, signals, params, pragmas) as
     4	//! structured AST while keeping the module body as raw text. Supports
     5	//! adding/removing ports, signals, instances, and logic by manipulating
     6	//! both the structured interface and the raw body text.
